  faq_t:'Frequently asked questions', faq_sub:'Everything you need to know before ordering — and if a question remains, message us on WhatsApp.',
  fq1_q:'When will my order arrive?', fq1_a:'Within Tangier, most orders placed before 4:00 PM arrive the same day — after that, next day. Arrange the exact time with us on WhatsApp.',
  fq2_q:'How do I pay?', fq2_a:'Cash on delivery (COD) — you pay in cash when your bouquet arrives. Never in advance.',
  fq3_q:'How long do satin roses last?', fq3_a:'A full year and more with a little care — no water, no light needed; the color and the silky touch stay.',
  fq4_q:'How do I care for the bouquet?', fq4_a:'Keep it away from direct sunlight, humidity and dust — a gentle puff of air now and then makes it look new again.',
  fq5_q:'Can I exchange the bouquet?', fq5_a:'Yes — if a product arrives faulty or not as ordered, message us within 48 hours of delivery with a photo and we replace it for free.',
  fq6_q:'Do you take special orders (weddings, big events)?', fq6_a:'With pleasure — large quantities, custom colors, bespoke styling. Message us on WhatsApp for a tailored quote.',
  priv_t:'Privacy Policy',
  pv1_t:'Who we are', pv1_a:'“Rose by Marry” is a family workshop in Tangier, Morocco, specialized in handmade satin roses. Contact: WhatsApp 0772966980.',
  pv2_t:'Data we collect', pv2_a:'No accounts, no sign-up: your cart, wishlist and language live only in your own browser (local storage). Nothing is sent to any server.',
  pv3_t:'How order data is used', pv3_a:'The name, phone and address you enter at checkout are sent through WhatsApp solely to prepare and deliver your order — never used for anything else, never shared.',
  pv4_t:'Cookies', pv4_a:'We use simple local storage (language, theme, cart) to improve your experience — no ad tracking, no third-party analytics.',
  pv5_t:'Your rights — law 09-08', pv5_a:'Under Moroccan law 09-08 on personal data protection, you can view or delete your data anytime: clear this site’s data in your browser, or message us — we respond within 48 hours.',
  terms_t:'Terms & Conditions',
  to1_t:'Orders and payment', to1_a:'Every order is confirmed through WhatsApp; payment is cash on delivery (COD) only — never in advance.',
  to2_t:'Delivery', to2_a:'Tangier city only, usually same day for orders before 4:00 PM. Delivery fee: 20 DH — free over 500 DH.',
  to3_t:'48-hour exchange', to3_a:'Faulty or incorrect product? Message us within 48 hours of delivery with a photo — free replacement or refund.',
  to4_t:'Handmade nature', to4_a:'Every rose is made by hand and signed by its maker — slight variations in color or detail give each piece its character and are not defects.',
  to5_t:'Prices and offers', to5_a:'Prices in Moroccan dirhams as displayed. Promo codes and offers are subject to their own terms, usually one use per customer.',
  to6_t:'Applicable law', to6_a:'These terms fall under Moroccan law; disputes are settled amicably first, then before the competent courts of Tangier.',
